; GS: a weapon with no authored suicide gesture is refused outright -- the controller makes the victim
; throw it away and draw his knife (prohibit_suicide is exactly what GS sets on its own rgm-40). This
; rifle has no *_suicide motion in any of its omfs and no Gunslinger counterpart to take one from, so
